imbridge stickers: send-sticker {chatGuid, filePath, stickerId, stickerHash, label?, selectedMessageGuid?, partIndex?}
sends an image as a sticker. The file transfer is marked as one before it's registered with the daemon (isSticker,
stickerUserInfo and attributionInfo naming Messages' own UserGenerated sticker extension, as the stickers you make in
Messages carry), then sent on its own, or stuck onto a message part: associated type 1000 on "p:N/GUID" with that
part's range and {eogcd: 3}, centered at half size. Dispatched through the chat registry.

